ed </span><span begin="01:39.000" end="01:39.120">on </span><span begin="01:39.120" end="01:39.210">the </span><span begin="01:39.210" end="01:39.780">weekend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:39.780" end="01:42.510"><span begin="01:39.780" end="01:40.020">Get </span><span begin="01:40.020" end="01:40.470">messed </span><span begin="01:40.470" end="01:40.710">up </span><span begin="01:40.710" end="01:40.860">and </span><span begin="01:40.860" end="01:41.310">depressed </span><span begin="01:41.310" end="01:41.430">with </span><span begin="01:41.430" end="01:41.790">my </span><span begin="01:41.790" end="01:42.510">friends</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.540" end="01:46.830"><span begin="01:42.540" end="01:42.840">'Cause </span><span begin="01:42.840" end="01:42.930">I </span><span begin="01:42.930" end="01:43.170">don't </span><span begin="01:43.170" end="01:43.620">need</span><span begin="01:43.620" end="01:43.620">, </span><span begin="01:43.620" end="01:43.980">no</span><span begin="01:43.980" end="01:43.980">, </span><span begin="01:43.980" end="01:44.130">I </span><span begin="01:44.130" end="01:44.340">don't </span><span begin="01:44.340" end="01:44.820">need </span><span begin="01:44.820" end="01:46.830">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:47.340" end="01:49.260"><span begin="01:47.340" end="01:47.580">So </span><span begin="01:47.580" end="01:47.790">I'ma </span><span begin="01:47.790" end="01:48.000">take </span><span begin="01:48.000" end="01:48.060">a </span><span begin="01:48.060" end="01:48.450">drug </span><span begin="01:48.450" end="01:48.600">on </span><span begin="01:48.600" end="01:48.720">the </span><span begin="01:48.720" end="01:49.260">weekend</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:49.260" end="01:51.900"><span begin="01:49.260" end="01:49.530">Take </span><span begin="01:49.530" end="01:50.250">myself </span><span begin="01:50.250" end="01:50.460">outta </span><span begin="01:50.460" end="01:50.670">my </span><span begin="01